This copy is curated, not the whole skill. It carries SKILL.md, the craft floor
(reference/craft-floor.md) and the three mode references. The detector engine,
the `impeccable` launcher, the `/impeccable` commands, the hooks, live mode and
the doctor are not shipped, and SKILL.md was rewritten to say so: its Setup
section reads the craft floor and the mode reference directly, and every command,
script and launcher the upstream names but this copy does not carry is gone. The
remaining files are upstream's own bytes.
